/P 203 0 R
/E (Animae Caribe Festival  offers strategic partnership and investment opportunities designed to deliver regional impact, innovation, and long-term legacy. Partners benefit from high-visibility branding across festival platforms, direct access to creators and emerging IP, curated networking and pitch sessions, and opportunities to co-create programming aligned with the future of animation, gaming, and digital storytelling. Partners may invest through cash or in-kind contributions, recognizing that corporate social responsibility priorities differ across organizations; the most suitable approach can be explored in a follow-up meeting or call.)
